      "created_at": "2014-08-15T04:39:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm sure I'm missing an obvious answer somewhere, but the 1st Blade scenario says that the first time Blade has \"success\" at a scenario marker, he flips it. &nbsp;The second time, he removes it. &nbsp;So, what does it mean for him to have \"success\"? &nbsp;</p>",
