      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m sure I&#39;m missing an obvious answer somewhere, but the 1st Blade scenario says that the first time Blade has &quot;success&quot; at a scenario marker, he flips it. &nbsp;The second time, he removes it. &nbsp;So, what does it mean for him to have &quot;success&quot;? &nbsp;</p>",
