      "created_at": "2014-08-15T04:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I knew I was missing something obvious. &nbsp;I hadn't seen the scenario cards (such as \"Power Splice\") until I saw an answer to a different question on the forum.&nbsp;<br><br>As a general comment, I would have found it very helpful to have a \"Setting Up\" page or some such in the rulebook. &nbsp;I had no idea that I should pull out specific scenario cards.</p>",
